    "Mode keys come from installed Native SceneManager constants exported in work/re8-scene-constants.json; labels do not imply a live game. Reader must additionally gate native transition/boot state. Main Story is the application mode label; The Mercenaries and Shadows of Rose match installed English UI labels.",
    "Region and room split only at the explicit English label separator \" - \"; display separator is \" / \". Regional MapID fallback is emitted only if every named member agrees.",
    "AreaNameData maps AreaNameID.Hash -> MessageGUID independently; never conflate AreaNameID with RoomUnit.NameHash.",
    "ItemSpecificationData SpecUnits ItemID -> Basic.NameMessageID -> English message. Different mode item IDs retain independent entries; WeaponTypeHash is a category.",
    "REF tags resolve against exact installed message keys; presentation tags and repeated whitespace are normalized; rejected/dummy/missing labels omitted. Unknown runtime IDs remain unresolved."
